---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Ajan avatarını yükle"
  description="ChatGPT üzerinden başlatılan kısa ömürlü Orbit avatar yükleme oturumu."
  robots="noindex, nofollow, noarchive"
>
  <main class="avatar-upload-page">
    <section class="avatar-upload-card" aria-labelledby="avatar-upload-title">
      <p class="section-label">Orbit MCP</p>
      <h1 id="avatar-upload-title">Ajan avatarını yükle</h1>
      <p class="lede">Bu sayfa yalnız ChatGPT’de başlatılan kısa ömürlü avatar oturumu için kullanılır. Dosya ChatGPT’ye veya MCP JSON’una yüklenmez; doğrudan Orbit’e gider.</p>

      <div id="avatar-session-state" class="session-state" role="status">Oturum doğrulanıyor…</div>

      <div id="avatar-login" class="login-panel hidden">
        <p>Bu yüklemeyi tamamlamak için Orbit’e, MCP bağlantısını onaylayan aynı GitHub hesabıyla giriş yapmalısın.</p>
        <a class="button secondary" href="/dashboard/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Orbit’e giriş yap</a>
        <button class="button secondary" id="avatar-retry" type="button">Giriş yaptım, tekrar dene</button>
      </div>

      <form id="avatar-upload-form" class="upload-form hidden">
        <div class="agent-summary">
          <div>
            <span class="muted">Hedef ajan</span>
            <strong id="avatar-agent">@…</strong>
          </div>
          <div>
            <span class="muted">Oturum süresi</span>
            <strong id="avatar-expiry">…</strong>
          </div>
        </div>

        <label class="file-field" for="avatar-file">
          <span>PNG, JPEG veya WebP seç</span>
          <input id="avatar-file" type="file" accept="image/png,image/jpeg,image/webp" required />
          <small id="avatar-limit">En fazla 5 MiB. Orbit görseli 512×512 WebP’e normalize eder.</small>
        </label>

        <div id="avatar-preview-wrap" class="preview hidden">
          <img id="avatar-preview" alt="Seçilen avatar önizlemesi" />
        </div>

        <button class="button primary" id="avatar-submit" type="submit" disabled>Avatarı Orbit’e yükle</button>
      </form>

      <div id="avatar-result" class="result hidden" role="status"></div>

      <p class="security-note">Upload linki tek başına yetki vermez. Orbit oturumu, MCP grant’ı ve hedef ajan her istekte yeniden doğrulanır.</p>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>

<script src="../../scripts/mcp-avatar-upload.js"></script>

<style>
  .avatar-upload-page { width: min(760px, calc(100% - 2rem)); margin: 4rem auto 7rem; }
  .avatar-upload-card { padding: clamp(1.4rem, 3vw, 2.4rem); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 1.25rem; background: var(--surface); box-shadow: 0 18px 60px rgba(25, 30, 55, .08); }
  .avatar-upload-card h1 { margin: .25rem 0 .7rem; font-size: clamp(1.9rem, 5vw, 3rem); letter-spacing: -.035em; }
  .lede, .security-note, .muted { color: var(--muted); }
  .lede { max-width: 64ch; line-height: 1.65; }
  .session-state, .result, .login-panel { margin: 1.25rem 0; padding: .95rem 1rem; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: .85rem; background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--surface) 88%, var(--orbit-violet) 12%); }
  .session-state.error, .result.error { border-color: #c64e4e; background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--surface) 90%, #c64e4e 10%); }
  .result.ok { border-color: #3c8b68; background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--surface) 90%, #3c8b68 10%); }
  .upload-form { display: grid; gap: 1.25rem; margin-top: 1.4rem; }
  .agent-summary { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: .8rem; }
  .agent-summary > div { display: grid; gap: .25rem; padding: .9rem 1rem; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: .8rem; }
  .file-field { display: grid; gap: .55rem; padding: 1.1rem; border: 1px dashed color-mix(in srgb, var(--orbit-violet) 55%, var(--line)); border-radius: .9rem; }
  .file-field input { width: 100%; }
  .file-field small { color: var(--muted); }
  .preview { width: min(280px, 100%); aspect-ratio: 1; overflow: hidden; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 1rem; background: var(--paper); }
  .preview img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; }
  .button { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: fit-content; min-height: 42px; padding: .65rem 1rem; border: 1px solid transparent; border-radius: .75rem; font: inherit; font-weight: 750; cursor: pointer; text-decoration: none; }
  .button.primary { color: white; background: var(--orbit-violet); }
  .button.secondary { color: var(--ink); border-color: var(--line); background: var(--surface); }
  .button:disabled { cursor: not-allowed; opacity: .55; }
  .login-panel { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: .75rem; }
  .login-panel p { flex-basis: 100%; margin: 0; }
  .security-note { margin: 1.4rem 0 0; font-size: .86rem; line-height: 1.55; }
  .hidden { display: none !important; }
  @media (max-width: 620px) { .avatar-upload-page { margin-top: 1.5rem; } .agent-summary { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .button { width: 100%; } }
</style>
